  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine: Meritocratic and Transparent Selection of the Head of the Customs Service of Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To provide technical, organizational, logistical, and expert support to the Selection Commission for the Head of the State Customs Service (SCS) in conducting a transparent, impartial, meritocratic, and efficient recruitment process.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiary: The Selection Commission for the Head of the SCS.Indirect beneficiaries: Government of Ukraine, SCS, the Ukrainian and foreign businesses and traders, employees of the citizens of Ukraine, and SCS employees.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to strengthen the integrity, professionalism, and transparency of Ukraine&#x2019;s Customs Service through a credible and meritocratic selection of its leadership.</narrative>
  </description>
